
Examples for the talk 
Adventures in the Parallelization of Evolutionary and Genetic Algorithms,
ECDA 2026, September 9 - 11, 2026, Stralsund Germany.

1. Build xega configuration with TSP data:

Rscript buildTSPlin105.R

2. rds on notebook:

./cleanDirectories.sh
./rdsRun.sh rdsTSPlin105Hom.R 

./cleanDirectories.sh
./rdsTerminals.sh rdsTSPlin105Hom.R 

3. mpi on notebook:

./cleanDirectories.sh
./mpiRun.sh mpiTSPlin105Hom.R 

./cleanDirectories.sh
./mpiTerminals.sh mpiTSPlin105Hom.R 

4. Slurm on HPC:

./cleanDirectories.sh
sbatch <slurmscript>

